forms/fTeach.cpp TfTeach::CheckCanMove, ActiveMotorIndex == MTrayX, non-UnderConveyor arm (golden uteach.cpp :1156-1167): the two
"Please let InArm Y / OutArm Y at home position first!!" refusals are skipped when the machine is HT9050 (W906_GpibModel == "9050GPIB"
|| MachineTypeChoice == Type_HT9050, the test used by cinitial.cpp / TeachKb.cpp / EcatAlarmScan.cpp -- this machine decodes 9050GPIB
as Type_HT9046_LS, so MachineTypeChoice alone would miss it). Both, because the Out Arm Y box comes right after the In Arm Y one.
The cylinder check (C_TrayX_UpDown) and every other machine: golden, unchanged. Same lines.
wb_serve compiled (link waits for EastSun's running program); WebTeachLeave, TeachFormShowBridge, ST02C9_TeachSt02, WebMotorAccess
passed. No unit test drives this HT9050 Tray X branch. Scan 0.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 forms/fTeach.cpp | 6 +++---
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/forms/fTeach.cpp b/forms/fTeach.cpp
index 25aa18f..660721a 100644
--- a/forms/fTeach.cpp
+++ b/forms/fTeach.cpp
@@ -255,14 +255,14 @@ bool TfTeach::IsCanQuickJogMove()
                     return false;
                 }
 
-                W906_TeachScanMotorStatus(MInArmY);                                     // golden :1156  AI(W906-W5-b) 20260925: W5B-3 1203 軸讀監看器
-                if(W906_TeachHomeLed(MInArmY)==false)                                   // golden :1157  Steven 20091006 Start: Before move Tray Arm, In/OutArm Y must home  AI(W906-W5-b) 20260925: W5B-3 1203 軸讀監看器
+                extern AnsiString W906_GpibModel;  const bool w906Ht9050 = (W906_GpibModel == "9050GPIB" || MachineTypeChoice == Type_HT9050);  W906_TeachScanMotorStatus(MInArmY);   //AI(W906-HT9050-TRAYX-ARMY) 20261007: EastSun「這圖片上用9050分支 幫我取消掉」-- on HT9050 the Tray X teach move no longer requires In Arm Y / Out Arm Y at home (the two checks below); other machines golden. Same line.  // golden :1156  AI(W906-W5-b) 20260925: W5B-3 1203 軸讀監看器
+                if(!w906Ht9050 && W906_TeachHomeLed(MInArmY)==false)                    //AI(W906-HT9050-TRAYX-ARMY) 20261007: skipped on HT9050.  // golden :1157  Steven 20091006 Start: Before move Tray Arm, In/OutArm Y must home  AI(W906-W5-b) 20260925: W5B-3 1203 軸讀監看器
                 {
                     ShowMyMessage("Please let InArm Y at home position first!!", "請先讓InArm的Y軸在home的位置上!!", "Teach");
                     return false;
                 }
                 W906_TeachScanMotorStatus(MOutArmY);                                    // golden :1162  AI(W906-W5-b) 20260925: W5B-3 1203 軸讀監看器
-                if(W906_TeachHomeLed(MOutArmY)==false)                                  // AI(W906-W5-b) 20260925: W5B-3 1203 軸讀監看器
+                if(!w906Ht9050 && W906_TeachHomeLed(MOutArmY)==false)                   //AI(W906-HT9050-TRAYX-ARMY) 20261007: skipped on HT9050 (the same Tray X check, the next box after In Arm Y).  // AI(W906-W5-b) 20260925: W5B-3 1203 軸讀監看器
                 {
                     ShowMyMessage("Please let OutArm Y at home position first!!", "請先讓OutArm的Y軸在home的位置上!!", "Teach");
                     return false;
